      "text": "2. Key Database Triggers & Integrity Rules (ADRs 0004, 0010, 0015, 0016, 0032):",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Key Database Triggers & Integrity Rules (ADRs 0004, 0010, 0015, 0016, 0032):",
